WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.000
Seventy-eight minutes gone here at the Harborside Arena, and it is still one apiece.

1
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.200
Harbor City keeping it on the floor around the centre circle, nice and patient.

2
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.800
Ostergaard tries to shield it for Redcliffe, but he is crowded out.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.200
Nordvik-Ames steps across, Quintal reads it and nicks the ball away.

4
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.200
Thalberg has to turn and chase now.

5
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.400
Harbor City spread it wide, they have numbers going forward.

6
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.900
Tobiah Lark is away, he cuts inside, into the box...

7
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.100
Lark shoots!

8
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.300
Saved by Zielonka! But it's loose...

9
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.400
And Asante-Brook bundles it in! Harbor City lead!

10
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.000
Kofi Asante-Brook, first to the rebound, and it is two-one Harbor City.

11
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.800
Arms out wide, he races away, and the home end is bouncing.

12
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.800
Zielonka with his hands on his head. He did so well to stop the first one.

13
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.800
The whole team piles on, Dahlquist, Lark, Okafor-Hale and Vesterberg in the huddle.

14
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.600
Let's see it again from the camera inside the net.

15
00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:49.600
Lark's effort is palmed away, and Asante-Brook reacts quickest to slide it home.

16
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.600
Nothing the goalkeeper could do about the second chance.

17
00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:57.600
Captain Bram Eijsden catching his breath. A big lead to protect now.

18
00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:59.800
Redcliffe have it all to do with a little over ten minutes left.
